    <attachmentsrequired>0</attachmentsrequired>
    <graderinfo format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>Credit for: (1) assuming a largest integer \(N\); (2) considering \(N+1\); (3) noting \(N+1>N\) is also an integer; (4) stating the contradiction and conclusion.</p>]]></text></graderinfo>
